SDV Valeo:

VSS :
    Sensor Signal CameraFrame (SSP 40ms+/-1ms offset 0ms+/-0ms, DL 10ms+/-2ms) 
    Actuator Signal Screen (period 15ms+/-1ms offset 0ms+/-0ms, AD 4ms+/-1ms)
App :
    Component Recognition :
        Service S:
            subscribe to VSS signal CameraFrame
            publish to VSS signal Screen
            trigger on CameraFrame
            execution 100ms+/-30ms

Functional Chains:
    chain : CameraFrame -> S -> Screen